{
  "mark.8.p1.b1": {
    "text": "そのころ、また大ぜいの群衆が集まっていたが、何も食べるものがなかった",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p1.b2": {
    "text": "この群衆がかわいそうである。もう三日間もわたしと一緒にいるのに、何も食べるものがない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p1.b3": {
    "text": "もし、彼らを空腹のまま家に帰らせるなら、途中で弱り切ってしまうであろう。それに、なかには遠くからきている者もある。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b1": {
    "text": "こんな荒野で、どこからパンを手に入れて、これらの人々にじゅうぶん食べさせることができましょうか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b2": {
    "text": "パンはいくつあるか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b3": {
    "text": "七つあります",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b1": {
    "text": "そこでイエスは群衆に地にすわるように命じられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b2": {
    "text": "そして七つのパンを取り、感謝してこれをさき、人々に配るように弟子たちに渡されると、弟子たちはそれを群衆に配った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b3": {
    "text": "また小さい魚が少しばかりあったので、祝福して、それをも人々に配るようにと言われた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b1": {
    "text": "彼らは食べて満腹した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b2": {
    "text": "そして残ったパンくずを集めると、七かごになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b3": {
    "text": "人々の数はおよそ四千人であった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b4": {
    "text": "すぐ弟子たちと共に舟に乗って、ダルマヌタの地方へ行かれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b1": {
    "text": "パリサイ人たちが出てきて、イエスを試みようとして議論をしかけ、天からのしるしを求めた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b2": {
    "text": "なぜ、今の時代はしるしを求めるのだろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b3": {
    "text": "よく言い聞かせておくが、しるしは今の時代には決して与えられない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b4": {
    "text": "そして、イエスは彼らをあとに残し、また舟に乗って向こう岸へ行かれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b1": {
    "text": "弟子たちはパンを持って来るのを忘れていたので、舟の中にはパン一つしか持ち合わせがなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b2": {
    "text": "パリサイ人のパン種とヘロデのパン種とを、よくよく警戒せよ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b3": {
    "text": "これは自分たちがパンを持っていないためであろう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b1": {
    "text": "なぜ、パンがないからだと論じ合っているのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b2": {
    "text": "まだわからないのか、悟らないのか。あなたがたの心は鈍くなっているのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b3": {
    "text": "目があっても見えないのか。耳があっても聞えないのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b4": {
    "text": "まだ思い出さないのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b1": {
    "text": "五つのパンをさいて五千人に分けたとき、拾い集めたパンくずは、幾つのかごになったか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b2": {
    "text": "十二かごです",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b3": {
    "text": "七かごです",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b4": {
    "text": "まだ悟らないのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b1": {
    "text": "そのうちに、彼らはベツサイダに着いた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b2": {
    "text": "すると人々が、ひとりの盲人を連れてきて、さわってやっていただきたいとお願いした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b3": {
    "text": "イエスはこの盲人の手をとって、村の外に連れ出し",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b4": {
    "text": "何か見えるか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p10.b1": {
    "text": "人が見えます。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p10.b2": {
    "text": "木のように見えます。歩いているようです。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b1": {
    "text": "それから、イエスが再び目の上に両手を当てられると",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b2": {
    "text": "盲人は見つめているうちに、なおってきて、すべてのものがはっきりと見えだした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b3": {
    "text": "村にはいってはいけない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b1": {
    "text": "さて、イエスは弟子たちとピリポ・カイザリヤの村々へ出かけられたが",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b2": {
    "text": "人々は、わたしをだれと言っているか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b3": {
    "text": "バプテスマのヨハネだと、言っています。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b4": {
    "text": "また、エリヤだと言い、また、預言者のひとりだと言っている者もあります。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b1": {
    "text": "それでは、あなたがたはわたしをだれと言うか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b2": {
    "text": "あなたこそキリストです",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b3": {
    "text": "するとイエスは、自分のことをだれにも言ってはいけないと、彼らを戒められた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b1": {
    "text": "それから、…彼らに教えはじめ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b2": {
    "text": "人の子は必ず多くの苦しみを受け",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b3": {
    "text": "長老、祭司長、律法学者たちに捨てられ、また殺され",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b4": {
    "text": "そして三日の後によみがえるべきことを",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b1": {
    "text": "しかもあからさまに、この事を話された。すると、ペテロはイエスをわきへ引き寄せて、いさめはじめた",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b2": {
    "text": "サタンよ、引きさがれ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b3": {
    "text": "あなたは神のことを思わないで、人のことを思っている。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b1": {
    "text": "それから群衆を弟子たちと一緒に呼び寄せて、彼らに言われた",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b2": {
    "text": "だれでもわたしについてきたいと思うなら",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b3": {
    "text": "自分を捨て",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b4": {
    "text": "自分の十字架を負うて、わたしに従ってきなさい。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b1": {
    "text": "自分の命を救おうと思う者はそれを失い",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b2": {
    "text": "わたしのため、また福音のために、自分の命を失う者は、それを救うであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b3": {
    "text": "人が全世界をもうけても、自分の命を損したら、なんの得になろうか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b4": {
    "text": "また、人はどんな代価を払って、その命を買いもどすことができようか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b1": {
    "text": "邪悪で罪深いこの時代にあって、わたしとわたしの言葉とを恥じる者に対しては",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b2": {
    "text": "人の子もまた、父の栄光のうちに聖なる御使たちと共に来るときに",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b3": {
    "text": "その者を恥じるであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
